        <mxCell id="note_05_cal_dfd" value="Verdict: PASS | PASS_WITH_NOTE (AWN, wajib e-sign QO) | NOT_PASS (→ deviasi). OOT bukan status titik — kondisi OOS pada alat yang terpakai produksi → Risk Assessment. Drift 4-tier: ≤0.1×tol keep · &gt;0.1×tol → 50% · konstan → 50% + correction factor · REJECTED → decommission." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=18;dashed=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#475569;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
